WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.175
Celine, today is your tenth birthday.

2
00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.550
First, I want to read a note your teacher, Ms. Yang, wrote about you.

3
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:11.300
Since school started, you’ve stayed focused in class.

4
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.375
You listen carefully and think things through.

5
00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:17.437
You also speak up and share your ideas.

6
00:00:17.437 --> 00:00:21.037
As my little helper, you jump in with a warm heart.

7
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:24.575
You’re responsible, and you keep things organized.

8
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:27.087
That deserves real praise.

9
00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:29.212
I’m so proud of you!

10
00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:32.012
Keep it up—and keep working hard.

11
00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:34.775
Your teacher wrote that she’s proud of you.

12
00:00:34.775 --> 00:00:36.400
I am too.

13
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.950
Getting this note from your teacher makes me happier than seeing a better grade.

14
00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.337
You’re in fourth grade now.

15
00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:45.787
You’re growing up so fast.

16
00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:47.512
A big girl?

17
00:00:47.512 --> 00:00:50.687
Okay, I know you don’t like being called that.

18
00:00:50.687 --> 00:00:53.037
You’re so polite to people.

19
00:00:53.037 --> 00:00:57.712
Whenever we come into our community, you say hi to the security guards.

20
00:00:57.712 --> 00:01:00.025
You’re friendlier than I am!

21
00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:05.062
You’re curious, and you love asking all kinds of funny, unexpected questions.

22
00:01:05.062 --> 00:01:07.450
I love your curiosity.

23
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:09.725
Keep wondering, “Why?

24
00:01:09.725 --> 00:01:12.512
I really admire how brave you are.

25
00:01:12.512 --> 00:01:16.687
You got up on stage and danced alongside a whole group of people.

26
00:01:16.687 --> 00:01:20.912
You showed what you could do in front of the dance teachers and the cameras.

27
00:01:20.912 --> 00:01:22.912
That was so cool!

28
00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:26.387
You like looking pretty, and you love sleeping in.

29
00:01:26.387 --> 00:01:29.812
You make funny faces whenever we take pictures.

30
00:01:29.812 --> 00:01:32.775
You finish your homework really quickly.

31
00:01:32.775 --> 00:01:35.962
I think your classmates see you as a good friend.

32
00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:41.262
Your watch is always ringing because your friends are always looking for you and asking you to play.

33
00:01:41.262 --> 00:01:43.375
You cheered your friend up.

34
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:45.350
You’re a good friend.

35
00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.225
To Mom and me, you’re a good friend too.

36
00:01:48.225 --> 00:01:53.975
You’re our travel buddy, our after-dinner walking buddy, our photo buddy, and our food buddy.

37
00:01:53.975 --> 00:01:56.887
You’re not just a great helper at school.

38
00:01:56.887 --> 00:01:59.487
You help out at home, too.

39
00:01:59.487 --> 00:02:05.762
When you get home from school, you start the washing machine, and when the laundry’s done, you help hang up the clothes.

40
00:02:05.762 --> 00:02:12.587
You help us wash vegetables, and you’ve gone downstairs to buy soy sauce, ginger, garlic, and even pork for us.

41
00:02:12.587 --> 00:02:15.712
Thank you for helping us with all those things.

42
00:02:15.712 --> 00:02:19.937
You make our family feel like we have one more dependable teammate.

43
00:02:19.937 --> 00:02:23.687
I love playing games with you and shooting hoops at your school.

44
00:02:23.687 --> 00:02:29.400
We go hiking together, walk by the river in the morning, and ride our bikes up the nearby hills.

45
00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:35.562
When I take you to school or to your classes on my electric scooter, you wrap your arms tightly around my waist.

46
00:02:35.562 --> 00:02:41.975
When I go away on a business trip, you always walk me to the gate of our community and watch me get into the car.

47
00:02:41.975 --> 00:02:48.512
I hope you keep growing a little every day—in height, of course, but even more in your mind and in all the things you learn.

48
00:02:48.512 --> 00:02:51.562
You’re so good at looking after your friends.

49
00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:54.850
And I hope you’ll take good care of yourself, too.

50
00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:59.575
Eat well and give your body the good things it needs—milk, eggs, and meat.

51
00:02:59.575 --> 00:03:02.550
And remember to drink plenty of water.

52
00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.062
Do you remember what we said?

53
00:03:05.062 --> 00:03:09.625
When you take a drink, imagine the little people inside your body cheering?

54
00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:11.487
I’m proud of you!

55
00:03:11.487 --> 00:03:13.475
That’s all for now.

56
00:03:13.475 --> 00:03:15.975
Have a wonderful time today.

57
00:03:15.975 --> 00:03:17.787
Happy birthday.

58
00:03:17.787 --> 00:03:19.337
I love you.
